      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 rounded-2xl border border-ink/12 bg-bone p-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:p-8"><div><p class="label-mono text-signal-deep">Savings calculator</p><h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-[28px] tracking-[-.03em]">What could a slow report cost you?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/75">A simple estimate: one unplanned repair per 1,000 miles, at an average cost of $420,000. Move the slider to see the risk.</p></div><div><label class="field-label">Miles of pipe you manage · {{ miles.toLocaleString() }}</label><input v-model.number="miles" type="range" min="100" max="20000" step="100" class="w-full accent-[#ff5a1f]"><div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="rounded-lg bg-ink p-4 text-bone"><p class="font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-bone/75">Yearly platform cost</p><p class="mt-1 font-display text-[27px]">{{ money(annual) }}</p></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-mint/20 p-4"><p class="font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-mint-deep">Potential loss avoided</p><p class="mt-1 font-display text-[27px] text-mint-deep">{{ money(savings) }}</p></div></div></div></div>
